  "evidence": [
    "Pinned original592140..592248 forms signed avg=(x+y)>>1 and x_diff=x-avg; arithmetic right shifts feed the first test, signed divide-by-four with negative correction feeds the final test. Current uint32_t avg forces unsigned division for that last expression. Authorize exactly avg type uint32_t -> int in goody_at; all other bodies, statements, expressions, unchecked coordinate lookup, flags/rule precedence, tile/climate reads and seed behavior remain unchanged. No game bug fix, input guard or initialization change. Whole Map identities are measurement/preservation scope only.",
    "Reviewed oct23k large097-120 discovery is bounded: x=-2,y=1 maps to in-allocation MapLongitude-1 with ordinary two-row dimensions, despite x being logically out of map domain. Zero relevant bits, non-ocean tile, rule clear, MapRandSeed18 yields original0 versus current1 because signed -1/4 truncates to0. Verify original pin and complete current-source witness independently, not only arithmetic fragments. No ordinary caller reachability is asserted. bonus_at shift differences are masked modulo16; no demonstrated output defect there and no header edit authorized. Its previous int-avg matching trial remains exhausted.",
    "Worker may add exactly the actual-source host test, extracting complete goody_at plus actual map_loc/bit_at/is_ocean/altitude_at dependencies where viable with modeled source storage and real named constants. Cover ordinary coordinate/state gates plus out-of-logical-domain/in-allocation signed witness. Compile-success mutant restoring unsigned avg must fail the same signed witness after positive passes under GCC/Clang; do not claim original binary execution from a source oracle. Record exact pin signed divide/read evidence separately. No fabricated memory validity, missing branch/call assertions, original-address execution, raw byte copying or UB-dependent host arithmetic.",
    "Coordinator owns source edit, native Task/Git/preparation/compiler/resources/annotation and integration. One actual retained production-recipe candidate with baseline replay, unchanged overlay replica and unsigned-regression damage controls; cap3candidate attempts per unchanged context, errors count. Preserve complete identity/spans/history/claims, compare every Map function and native outside-body residual; no extended tuning, claim demotion, instrumentation or policy changes. Independent review, fresh application build/link, reference/source/claim checks and fresh destination verification precede manually reviewed integration. No new exact/body coverage/full game acceptance is assumed."
  ],
